</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In SuperGlasses: Benchmarking Vision Language Models as Intelligent Agents for AI Smart Glasses" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Details of <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SuperLens</span></span></a>
